---
import type { Variant } from '../../data/variants';
import PrimaryAction from '../shared/PrimaryAction.astro';
import { samples } from '../../data/samples';
interface Props {
  variant: Variant;
}
const { variant } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-24 lg:px-12">
  <p class="border-y border-ink/50 py-2 text-center font-editorial text-[clamp(70px,10vw,140px)] font-bold tracking-[-.08em]">
    deepK
  </p>
  <div class="grid items-end gap-10 pt-16 pb-10 md:grid-cols-[1.3fr_.7fr]">
    <h1 class="font-editorial text-[clamp(35px,4.5vw,64px)] leading-[1.4] font-bold tracking-[-.055em]">
      {variant.headline.map((line) => (
        <span class="block">{line}</span>
      ))}
    </h1>
    <div>
      <p class="mb-7 max-w-sm text-sm leading-8 text-muted">{variant.description}</p>
      <PrimaryAction dark />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid gap-8 border-t border-ink/50 pt-8 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16">
    <article class="md:border-r md:border-line md:pr-12">
      <p class="mb-8 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[.18em]">ORIGINAL · ENGLISH</p>
      <p class="font-editorial text-xl leading-10">
        Great tools disappear into the work. You stop noticing them, and start noticing what you can
        finally do.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-5 bg-accent p-3 font-editorial text-xl leading-9">{samples[0].source}</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="mb-8 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[.18em]">TRANSLATION · 한국어</p>
      <p class="font-editorial text-xl leading-10 text-muted">
        좋은 도구는 작업 속으로 스며듭니다. 도구를 의식하지 않게 되고, 마침내 할 수 있게 된 일에
        집중하게 됩니다.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 font-editorial text-xl leading-10 font-semibold">{samples[0].result}</p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-xs text-muted">설명용 예시 번역</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
